  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.0\n- Reworked navigation service with parameter passing, navigation guards, lifecycle callbacks and popups.\n- New validation API for view models, with sync and async rules, server-side errors and localizable messages.\n- New XAML validation support for input controls.\n- Fixes for several input controls.\n\n1.2\n- Support for .NET 10 and nullable reference types.\n- New UrlBuilder and QueryBuilder helpers.\n- New ItemTappedBehavior for CollectionView.\n- New CompositeResxTranslationProvider, configurable through SuperdevMauiOptions.\n- Configurable LoggingHandler (media types, filtered and suppressed headers).\n\n1.1\n- Migration to .NET MAUI 9.\n- New HyperlinkButton control and IBrowser service.\n- Style overrides through \"_Override\" style keys.\n- Done button for Entry and Editor on iOS.\n- Fixes for NullableDatePicker, NullableTimePicker and CustomPicker on iOS.\n\n1.0\n- Initial release.",
